# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Gadgetzan

step Gadgetzan
  zone Tanaris
  tip The hearth lands in Gadgetzan: Andi Lynn takes the Dunemaul Compound, done on the way into the crater.
  turnin 5863                         -- Andi Lynn
  turnin 4504                         -- Tran'rek

step Gadgetzan
  when onquest 4496
  zone Tanaris
  turnin 4496                         -- Alchemist Pestlezugg, inside

step Orgrimmar
  only Hunter,Shaman
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Fly to Orgrimmar and train before the boat to Powderfuse Port: the Undercity stop later in this guide has no Hunter or Shaman trainer.
  fly "Orgrimmar"
  train class

step Back to Gadgetzan
  only Hunter,Shaman
  zone Orgrimmar
  goto 45.3,63.7 "Orgrimmar flight master"
  fly "Gadgetzan"

step Boat to Powderfuse Port
  zone Tanaris
  goto 67.6,23.1 "Boat to Powderfuse Port"
  accept 4324                         -- Yorba Screwspigot, by the dock: for Yuka Screwspigot at Flame Crest, later in this guide

step Badlands
  zone Badlands
  tip Leave Riverglades on foot to the north-west, north of Twilight's Shroud, into the Badlands.
  goto 3.4,48.1 "Kargath"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Kargath

step Kargath
  zone Badlands
  tip Kargath is built into the cliffs on the Badlands' west edge.
  accept 3821                         -- Thal'trak Proudtusk

step The WANTED poster
  when dungeon "Blackrock Depths"
  zone Badlands
  tip For your Blackrock Depths run, next, on the way through Blackrock Mountain: the WANTED poster in Kargath wants the Anvilrage dwarves inside thinned out.
  accept 4081 object 164867           -- WANTED

step Into the Searing Gorge
  zone Searing Gorge
  tip Take the pass out of Kargath's west side into the Searing Gorge, then ride south across the gorge to the long bridge into Blackrock Mountain. Inside, follow the chain walkways down and leave through the southern exit; stay off the paths to the dungeon portals.
  goto 34.8,83.0 "Bridge into Blackrock Mountain"

step Blackrock Depths
  when dungeon "Blackrock Depths"
  when onquest 4081
  zone Searing Gorge
  tip Blackrock Depths is a dungeon for a group of five from about level 48, the biggest in the mountain: its Anvilrage dwarves are this quest's, and you need not go further in than they are. Its portal is deep inside the mountain, down the chain walkways from the bridge.
  tip Inside: the Anvilrage Guardsmen, Wardens and Footmen. Then back out of the portal and on through the mountain's southern exit to the Burning Steppes.
  enter "Blackrock Depths" @34.8,85.3
  complete 4081 @34.8,85.3            -- KILL ON SIGHT: Dark Iron Dwarves: the Anvilrage dwarves, inside

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Burning Steppes

step Flame Crest
  zone Burning Steppes
  tip The mountain lets you out beside Blackrock Stronghold, full of 55-57 orcs. Follow the road east along the northern cliffs to the Horde camp at Flame Crest.
  getfp "Flame Crest"
  accept 4296                         -- Maxwort Uberglint
  accept 4726                         -- Tinkee Steamboil
  turnin 4324                         -- Yuka Screwspigot

step Sha'ni Proudtusk
  tip Follow the cliffs south to Dreadmaul Rock, the Firegut ogres' hill. Sha'ni Proudtusk's remains lie at its foot.
  turnin 3821

step Sha'ni Proudtusk
  when level>=53
  tip Only from level 53: her next errand is Krom'Grul (54), who walks the caves of Dreadmaul Rock among ogres of 50-53.
  accept 3822

step Krom'Grul
  when onquest 3822
  tip Krom'Grul walks the caves and mine tunnels of Dreadmaul Rock; if he isn't home, clear the ogres around the entrances until he comes back.
  collect 11058 quest 3822            -- Below ground

step Ruins of Thaurissan: kill these as you meet them
  zone Burning Steppes
  tip Ride west to the dig site. The Tablet of the Seven stands in its middle among the Thaurissan dwarves. Copy it.
  tip Black Broodlings nest in the hills just east of Flame Crest. Use Tinkee's Draco-Incarcinatrix 900 on a broodling when it is almost dead to capture its essence.
  tip Careful: a Black Dragonspawn and a Black Drake, elites of 50-53, wander the same hills: pull the broodlings away from them, or bring a group.
  collect 12283 quest 4726 @81.0,28.0
  use 12284 quest 4726.1 @81.0,28.0 map 1428
  collect 11470 quest 4296 @54.1,40.8

step Flame Crest
  tip Back north-east to Flame Crest.
  turnin 4296                         -- Maxwort Uberglint
  turnin 4726                         -- Tinkee Steamboil
  accept 4808
  note Keep Tinkee's letter: Felnok Steelspring is in Everlook, Winterspring.

