# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Undercity and the Bulwark

step Undercity
  zone Undercity
  accept 3568                         -- Chemist Cuely, the Apothecarium: the vials fill in Azshara later
  turnin 864                          -- Apothecary Zinge, near Cuely in the Apothecarium
  train class only Warrior,Paladin,Rogue,Priest,Mage,Warlock

step Tirisfal Glades
  zone Tirisfal Glades
  goto 83.3,72.3 "The Bulwark"

step The Bulwark
  zone Tirisfal Glades
  tip Leave the Undercity and ride east along the road through Tirisfal Glades to the Bulwark, the Forsaken fort on the border.
  note Take a Box of Incendiaries from the crate next to Derrington for Scarlet Diversions, done on the way back. Equip the Argent Dawn Commission: Scourgestones only drop while you wear it.
  turnin 5094                         -- High Executor Derrington
  accept 5096
  turnin 5405 direct
# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Western Plaguelands

step Scarlet forward camp
  zone Western Plaguelands
  tip From the Bulwark, follow the road east into the Western Plaguelands. The Scarlet Crusade's tents stand just past Felstone Farm, between Felstone Field and Dalson's Tears. Torch the command tent with the Box of Incendiaries and plant the Scourge banner. Careful: the Scarlets around the tents reach 54 and the Invokers cast: come in from the side nearest the command tent and leave the others be.
  goto 40.7,52.0
  interact 176088
  complete 5096

step Janice Felstone
  tip Back a few steps west to Felstone Farm, the first farm along the road; Janice waits in the house.
  accept 5021                         -- Upstairs
  turnin 5021                         -- Janice's Parcel, beside the house; inside
  accept 5023
  note Keep the parcel: Royal Overseer Bauhaus is in the Undercity. Keep A Plague Upon Thee: its termite mounds are in Terrordale, on the next guide's ride to Tirion. The next guide starts with Mulgris Deepriver by the Writhing Haunt, south-east of here.
